===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Concerned with [[theories]] or [[hypotheses]] rather than with [[practical]] matters.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1826|author=Rev. James Gilchrist|title=The Perpetuity of Christian Baptism Maintained|page=43
|passage=We shall, therefore, only very humbly submit whether the whole statement be not rather too '''theoretic''' and somewhat too darkly adumbrated in ambiguous phraseology for plain, ''uncollegian'' understandings.}}
# Existing only in [[theory]], not proven in [[reality]].

